ary</a></section></div><div class=\"p-3 border-t border-[#E2E8F0] grid grid-cols-4 gap-1\"><button id=\"short-settings\" class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[#6B7280] hover:bg-white/60 hover:text-[#334E68] transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:settings\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon></button><button id=\"short-help\" class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[#6B7280] hover:bg-white/60 hover:text-[#334E68] transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:help-circle\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon></button><button id=\"short-notif\" class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[#6B7280] hover:bg-white/60 hover:text-[#334E68] transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:bell\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon></button><button id=\"short-logout\" class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[#6B7280] hover:bg-white/60 hover:text-red-500 transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:log-out\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon></button></div></aside><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden\"><header class=\"flex h-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white px-4 z-40\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#6B7280]\"><li>Home</li><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:chevron-right\" class=\"text-[10px]\"></iconify-icon><li class=\"font-semibold text-[#1F2937]\">Dashboard</li></ol></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><button id=\"search-trigger\" class=\"flex h-8 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-[#F8FAFC] px-3 text-xs text-[#6B7280] min-w-[180px]\">Search anything... <kbd class=\"ml-auto border bg-white px-1 rounded text-[10px] opacity-60\">⌘K</kbd></button><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l border-[#E2E8F0] pl-4\"><div class=\"text-right hidden sm:block\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#1F2937