      "prompt": "Refined Minimal Dashboard redesign. Clean up clutter and create breathing room: (1) Sidebar becomes sleeker — remove the search bar, reduce nav section label verbosity, group all AI Tools under a collapsible 'AI Studio' accordion with a glow badge instead of 12 separate items, add a quick-access toolbar of 4 icon-only shortcuts at the bottom. (2) The WelcomeBanner shrinks to a single compact row — greeting + date left, one Generate CTA right — saving vertical space for content. (3) Stat cards get a fresh layout: large number top, icon + label bottom in a horizontal row, with a thin colored bottom border instead of full border. (4) QuickActions become a compact horizontal pill-button row (not a card grid) — each pill has a small icon + label, subtle background fill. (5) Introduce a two-column dashboard layout: main content 60% left (charts + recent docs), sidebar panel 40% right (stats, quick actions, activity) to reduce scrolling. (6) Charts use soft gradient fills and no visible grid lines for a cleaner aesthetic. Maintain Inter font, Blue-Grey primary color family, 8px radius minimum, and all shadow tokens. Use ONLY the fonts, colors, spacing, and component styles defined in the design system.",
